Input: {"question": "When was Gerhard Meidell Gerhardsen born?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d00", "start": 0, "end": 161, "text": "Gerhard Meidell Gerhardsen (1848–1912) Gerhard Meidell Gerhardsen (9 July 1848 – 25 July 1912) was a Norwegian bailiff and politician for the Conservative Party."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d00", "start": 162, "end": 268, "text": "He was born at the farm Roalstvedt in Kvinnherred as a son of Clement Gerhardsen and Mette Dorthea Haavig."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d00", "start": 269, "end": 358, "text": "He worked as acting bailiff in Føyen from 1871 to 1872, and bailiff in Finnaas from 1872."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d00", "start": 359, "end": 410, "text": "From 1874 he was a member of the municipal council."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d00", "start": 411, "end": 512, "text": "He was also chairman of the savings bank Moster Sparebank, and worked as a farmer and school teacher."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d00", "start": 513, "end": 564, "text": "He was elected to the Parliament of Norway in 1892."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d00", "start": 565, "end": 571, "text": "He was"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d01", "start": 0, "end": 180, "text": "Gerhard Meidell Gerhardsen (1885–1931) Gerhard Meidell Gerhardsen (25 April 1885 – 28 July 1931) was a Norwegian bailiff and politician for the Conservative Party and Centre Party."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d01", "start": 181, "end": 335, "text": "He was born at the farm Teigland in Finnaas as a son of bailiff, farmer and politician Gerhard Meidell Gerhardsen (1848–1912) and Anna Trovik (1848–1933)."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d01", "start": 336, "end": 450, "text": "He took education at middle school and agricultural school, and started the career in his father's bailiff office."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d01", "start": 451, "end": 541, "text": "He became acting bailiff in 1912 when his father died, and also took over the family farm."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d01", "start": 542, "end": 611, "text": "He remained here until 1930, when he moved to become bailiff of Etne."}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d02", "start": 0, "end": 121, "text": "Gerhard Meidell Gerhardsen (economist) Gerhard Meidell Gerhardsen (3 June 1912 – 1 March 1986) was a Norwegian economist."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d02", "start": 122, "end": 262, "text": "He was born in Finnaas as a son of bailiff, farmer and politician Gerhard Meidell Gerhardsen (1885–1931) and Helga Marie Selmer (1888–1935)."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d02", "start": 263, "end": 354, "text": "He was a grandson of bailiff, farmer and politician Gerhard Meidell Gerhardsen (1848–1912)."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d02", "start": 355, "end": 477, "text": "He studied economics at the University of Oslo, and was hired in the Norwegian Directorate of Fisheries in Bergen in 1939."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d02", "start": 478, "end": 626, "text": "From 1947 to 1953 he led the Fisheries and Aquaculture Department of the Food and Agriculture Organization, and from 1952 to 1982 he was a professor"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0478-76a82d95f803:d03", "start": 0, "end": 461, "text": "history Tools Tools move to sidebar hide Actions Read Edit View history General What links here Rel